    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A Dialogue on Innovative Higher Education Strategies (DIES) initiative has been adopted in West Africa. This initiative follows a 10-year partnership between German Academic Exchange Service (DAAD), German Rectors' Conference (HRK) and the Inter-University Council for East Africa (IUCEA) to enhance quality assurance in the East Africa region.",
